+msgid "Use when one resource replaces another, as when a software release succeeds a retired release. Keep the predecessor in the graph (Principle 10)."
+msgstr "用于一种资源取代另一种资源的情形，例如新软件版本接替已退役的版本。将前身资源保留在图中（原则 10）。"
+
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/supersededBy|skos:definition"
-msgid "Links a resource to the resource that replaced it — Constantinople supersededBy Istanbul, the Soviet Union supersededBy the Russian Federation, a deprecated software release supersededBy its successor. Directional, NOT symmetric. The superseded resource is retained (never deleted). The universal logic:Thing signatures preserve the types of entities, claim tokens and reifiers. The relation itself prompts no display flag: whether a reader is shown the predecessor is that reader's policy, decided at projection, and the only suppression the lifecycle slice prompts is for a superseded name or identity label, which its holder hides from every reader. A more specific relation may state a stricter display rule of its own."
-msgstr "将一个资源与取代它的资源相连——君士坦丁堡被伊斯坦布尔取代、苏联被俄罗斯联邦取代、一个被弃用的软件发行版被其后继者取代。有方向性，并非对称。被取代的资源被保留（从不删除）。通用的 logic:Thing 签名保留实体、声明令牌和重述标识节点的类型。该关系本身不引发任何显示标记：读者是否看到前任由该读者自己的政策在投影时决定，生命周期切片唯一引发的隐藏针对被取代的名称或身份标签，其持有者会对所有读者隐藏它。更具体的关系可以另行规定其自身更严格的显示规则。"
+msgid "Links a predecessor resource to its replacement. The inverse is gmeow:supersedes. Retain the predecessor (Principle 10). The universal logic:Thing signatures preserve the types of entities, claim tokens and reifiers. Readers apply their own display policies at projection. The lifecycle slice prompts global suppression only for a superseded name or identity label."
+msgstr "将前身资源与取代它的资源相连。逆属性为 gmeow:supersedes。保留前身资源（原则 10）。通用的 logic:Thing 签名保留实体、主张标记和具化器的类型。读者在投影时应用各自的显示策略。生命周期模块只对已被替换的名称或身份标签提示全局隐藏。"
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/existenceEntityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
 msgid "existenceEntity is functional"
@@ -130,5 +138,5 @@ msgid "Assert gmeow:supersededBy from predecessor to successor; optionally recor
 msgstr "从前任向继任者断言 gmeow:supersededBy；可选择把变更本身记录为类型为 gmeow:eventTypeSupersession 的 gmeow:Event，并把面向未来的显示留给每位读者的投影；生命周期切片本身只对被取代的名称或身份标签引发 gmeow:displayable false。"
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SupersededEntitySuppressionConstraint|skos:definition"
-msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a superseded gmeow:Appellation (a name carrying gmeow:supersededBy) should set gmeow:displayable false — suppressed from display for every reader, never deleted (Principle 10). It is limited to names, the global safety case. A superseded entity of any other kind and a claim that another party disputes or corrects are not reported by this constraint: what a reader is shown of them is reader policy, decided at projection, unless a more specific constraint states a stricter rule of its own."
-msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：被取代的 gmeow:Appellation（带有 gmeow:supersededBy 的名称）应设置 gmeow:displayable false——对所有读者隐藏，绝不删除（原则 10）。它仅限于名称，即全局安全的情形。任何其他类型的被取代实体，以及被另一方质疑或更正的主张，都不会被此约束报告：读者对它们看到什么属于读者策略，在投影时决定，除非更具体的约束另行规定其自身更严格的规则。"
+msgid "Warns when a gmeow:Appellation carrying gmeow:supersededBy lacks gmeow:displayable false. The flag hides the superseded name from every reader and preserves the record (Principle 10). Readers apply their own display policies at projection for other superseded resources and for claims another party disputes or corrects."
+msgstr "当带有 gmeow:supersededBy 的 gmeow:Appellation 缺少 gmeow:displayable false 时发出警告。该标志对所有读者隐藏已被替换的名称，同时保留原记录（原则 10）。对于其他已被替换的资源，以及受到他方质疑或纠正的主张，读者在投影时应用各自的显示策略。"
